 * REFERENCE IMPLEMENTATION: walker-brain-next/tests/smoke/portal-deep.spec.ts
 * has 15 working tests (6 L2 + 4 L3 + 5 expansion) covering:
 *   L2: date filter, full-text search same-day, brand filter, case type filter,
 *       language filter, sort by quality, empty state, sidebar badge counts,
 *       status tab shift, today's-picks metric
 *   L3: batch publish flow (with paired revert), admin action visibility,
 *       form rendering, unauthenticated /admin block, click-to-detail
